From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 23:35:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Tune gfx1100 INT8 Triton GEMM

- Add four shape-specific model configurations.
- Keep defaults where measured candidates regress.
- Select M-specific tiles for irregular latency
  boundaries.
- Reduce selected warm-cache latency by 4-55%.
- Validate 32 routed shapes on a W7900.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: GPT-5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
---
